title: Nurse
---
<<if is_upset("Nurse")>>
    <<jump Nurse_Upset>>
<<elseif quest_status("snake") == "NotStarted">>
    <<jump Nurse_Ask>>
<<elseif quest_status("snake") == "Active" and quest_ready("snake")>>
    <<jump Nurse_Deliver>>
<<elseif quest_status("snake") == "Active">>
    <<jump Nurse_Waiting>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Nurse_Done>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Nurse_Ask
---
Nurse: morning

-> morning
    Mc: morning
    Nurse: you're friendlier than what people say huh
-> ….
    Mc: ….
    Nurse: Morning to you too
-> What do you want
    Mc: What do you want
    Nurse: straight to the point huh? I like that attitude

Nurse: I was hoping to find the five headed snake here

-> I don't have that
    Mc: I don't have that
    Nurse: well go get it can't you get anything?
-> ……..
    Mc: ……..

Nurse: I shall come back when you have it
Nurse: Later shop man

<<start_quest "snake">>
===

title: Nurse_Waiting
---
Nurse: Still nothing?
Mc: ……..
<<if days_left("snake") > 0>>
    Nurse: Don't take too long. Days left: {days_left("snake")}
<<endif>>
Nurse: Later shop man
===

title: Nurse_Deliver
---
Nurse: So? Found it yet?

-> it's all yours
    Mc: it's all yours
-> no
    Mc: no
    Mc: it's all yours

Nurse: I knew you could do it!
Nurse: here this is for your trouble
<<complete_quest "snake">>
Nurse: also you can stop by me when I smoke next to the ambulance I'll help get you whatever you want
===

title: Nurse_Done
---
Nurse: Later shop man
-> Spend the day with her (the day ends)
    Mc: Got some time?
    Nurse: For you? Sure.
    <<end_day>>
-> Leave
    Mc: Later
===

title: Nurse_Upset
---
Nurse: ...
Nurse: I don't need anything from you anymore.
===